    rule4Text: "高粘度淀粉产生的流体剪切阻力超过150瓦。轴封界面的剧烈摩擦热可在90秒内导致局部温度飙升至120°C以上，彻底烧毁密封圈并损坏电机。",
    copyReportBtn: "复制诊断数据分析报告",
    copiedFeedback: "诊断数据已成功复制到剪贴板！"
  },
  ja: {
    badge: "トライボロジー＆食品安全物理学",
    title: "ハンドブレンダー回転軸摩耗＆ベアリンググリース溶出モデラー",
    subtitle: "高温・高粘度スープの裏ごし・撹拌時におけるPTFE/NBR軸受シールの熱摩耗、遠心性炭化水素潤滑剤の食品移行、水力キャビテーション剪断力を精密解析。",
    controlsTitle: "ハンドブレンダー摩擦工学＆調理環境パラメータ",
    controlsSub: "駆動軸シール構造、スープ温度、流体粘度、回転速度(RPM)、連続稼働時間、脂質/酸度食品マトリックスを詳細設定。",
    archLabel: "駆動軸＆シール工学アーキテクチャ：",
    archHelp: "普及型ブロンズ軸受+NBRシール vs 中級ステンレス軸+PTFEバネ付きオイルシール vs 業務用水密メカニカルシール vs 経年劣化モデル。",
    tempLabel: "スープ・流体温度 (°C / °F)：",
    tempHelp: "冷製ドレッシング（20°C）から温かい野菜スープ（75°C）、コンロ上で煮立つ鍋（90°C〜100°C）まで。",
    viscLabel: "流体粘度と流体力学的ドラッグ抵抗：",
    viscHelp: "さらさらスープ（25 cP）vs 滑らかなポタージュ（1,200 cP）vs 繊維質ポテトピューレ（8,000 cP）vs 濃厚ひよこ豆ペースト（30,000 cP）。",
    speedLabel: "ブレード回転速度 (RPM)：",
    speedHelp: "8,000 RPM（低速撹拌）から22,000 RPM（ターボ高速・超音波キャビテーション域）まで。",
    durationLabel: "単回連続浸漬稼働時間：",
    durationHelp: "30秒パルス vs 2分家庭用標準 vs 5分大鍋じっくり vs 10分業務用連続熱浸漬。",
    matrixLabel: "食品マトリックス特性（油脂と酸度）：",
    matrixHelp: "中性清湯 vs 生クリーム・バター濃厚スープ（親脂性溶出）vs 高酸度トマトスープ（pH 3.8ゴム膨潤）。",
    presetsTitle: "実調理プリセット＆代表ケーススタディ：",
    presetBoilingTomato: "安価ブレンダーで煮立つトマトスープを撹拌（極度危険・高溶出リスク）",
    presetCommercialSquash: "業務用ヘビーデューティ機で85°Cカボチャをポタージュ化（NSF Standard 8完全準拠）",
    presetAgedPotato: "3年使用の劣化ブレンダーで高温ポテトマッシュを撹拌（シール破損と異物混入）",
    presetColdEmulsion: "20°C常温で冷製マヨネーズ・ソース乳化（潤滑油移行ゼロ・安全）",
    diagnosticTitle: "トライボロジー劣化＆潤滑剤移行診断カード",
    diagnosticSub: "食品中へのベアリンググリース移行濃度（mg/kg ppm）、シール熱応力・弾性損失率、キャビテーション摩耗度、FDA 21 CFR § 178.3570合規性を即時算出。",
    leachingLabel: "食品中への潤滑グリース溶出量 (FDA 10 ppm 基準)",
    sealStressLabel: "シャフトシールの熱応力＆弾性損失率",
    cavitationLabel: "遠心剪断＆水力キャビテーション摩耗指数",
    complianceLabel: "FDA 21 CFR § 178.3570 および NSF/ANSI 8 判定",
    mechanismLabel: "生物物理トライボロジー＆グリース乳化溶出メカニズム",
    guidanceLabel: "厨房工学是正プロトコル＆安全操作手順",
    scienceTitle: "トライボロジー・境界潤滑破壊とキャビテーション渦流動力学",
    scienceSub: "高温での石油グリース粘度低下とブレード直下の負圧渦流が、いかにして鉱物油や亜鉛添加剤を熱い料理中へ吸い出してしまうのか。",
    tableTitle: "ハンドブレンダー軸受・シール構造の工学的比較マトリックス",
    tableSub: "家庭用・業務用ブレンダーにおける熱機械的耐性、化学移行リスク、食品衛生規格適合性の完全比較。",
    colArch: "シャフト工学構造",
    colBearing: "ベアリング組立体",
    colSealMat: "シール接触素材",
    colTempCeiling: "許容耐熱温度 (°C)",
    colGreaseClass: "潤滑グリース種別",
    colCompliance: "食品接触衛生認証",
    rulesTitle: "ハンドブレンダー使用における4つの絶対安全原則",
    rulesSub: "有害な工業用石油グリースの誤食、軸受シールの破壊、および細菌増殖を防ぐための基本原則。",
    rule1Title: "1. コンロの火をつけたまま煮え立つ鍋（>80°C）に安価なブレンダーを直接投入しない",
    rule1Text: "一般的な家庭用ブレンダーのニトリルゴム（NBR）シールは80°Cが限界です。90°C以上の煮立つスープではグリースが液化し、高速回転するブレードの負圧渦が非食品グレードの鉱物油や亜鉛化合物をスープ中へ引き込みます。",
    rule2Title: "2. 食洗機による「負圧吸水トラップ」とベアリング汚染に注意",
    rule2Text: "シャフト一体型のブレンダー先端部を食洗機で高温洗浄すると、冷却時に内部が負圧になり、汚れた洗浄水、強アルカリ洗剤、耐熱細菌がベアリング室へ逆流吸い込みを起こします。",
    rule3Title: "3. ブレード回転軸の「黒いスラッジリング」を定期点検する",
    rule3Text: "ブレード根元の隙間に黒や灰色の粘着スラッジが付着している場合、シールは完全に破損しています。これは酸化した工業用グリースと削れた金属摩耗粉の有毒なエマルションです。直ちに使用を中止してください。",
    rule4Title: "4. ジャガイモや豆類など高粘度デンプンの連続撹拌は60秒以内に制限する",
    rule4Text: "硬い粘性ペーストの流体摩擦抵抗は150Wを超えます。摩擦熱により軸受シール部の局所温度は90秒以内に120°Cを超過し、ゴムシールを熱変形させモーターを焼損させます。",
    copyReportBtn: "診断データをクリップボードにコピー",
    copiedFeedback: "診断データレポートをコピーしました！"
  }
};

const d = DICTIONARY[lang];
---

<div class="immersion-blender-modeler bg-surface-soft border border-hairline rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-10 mb-12 shadow-sm" id="immersion-blender-modeler-app">
  <!-- Interactive Header -->
  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-hairline/80 pb-6 mb-8">
    <div>
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-700 dark:text-orange-400 mb-2 border border-orange-500/20">
        <span>⚙️</span>
        {d.badge}
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight">
        {d.title}
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-1 max-w-3xl">
        {d.subtitle}
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Presets -->
    <div class="w-full md:w-auto">
      <label for="blender-preset-select" class="block text-xs font-bold text-ink uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
        {d.presetsTitle}
      </label>
      <select 
        id="blender-preset-select" 
        class="w-full md:w-72 bg-surface text-ink text-xs font-medium rounded-xl border border-hairline px-3 py-2.5 shadow-2xs focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-500/30 focus:outline-hidden"
      >
        <option value="custom">-- Custom Configuration --</option>
        <option value="preset_boiling_tomato" selected>{d.presetBoilingTomato}</option>
        <option value="preset_commercial_squash">{d.presetCommercialSquash}</option>
        <option value="preset_aged_potato">{d.presetAgedPotato}</option>
        <option value="preset_cold_emulsion">{d.presetColdEmulsion}</option>
      </select>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Inputs Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 mb-10">
    <!-- Controls Column (Left) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
      <div class="bg-surface/60 border border-hairline rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-2xs space-y-5">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink border-b border-hairline/60 pb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>{d.controlsTitle}</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-normal text-muted lowercase">physics input panel</span>
        </h3>

        <!-- Control 1: Architecture -->
        <div>
          <label for="blender-arch" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-ink mb-1">
            {d.archLabel}
          </label>
          <select 
            id="blender-arch" 
            class="w-full bg-surface text-ink text-xs rounded-xl border border-hairline px-3 py-2.5 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-500/30 focus:outline-hidden"
          >
            {blenderData.shaftSealArchitectures.map((arch) => (
              <option value={arch.id} selected={arch.id === 'budget_sleeve_nbr'}>
                {arch.name}
              </option>
            ))}
          </select>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1 leading-normal">
            {d.archHelp}
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Control 2: Temperature -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
            <label for="blender-temp" class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
              {d.tempLabel}
            </label>
            <span id="temp-display-val" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400">
              90°C (194°F) - Simmering Stock
            </span>
          </div>
          <input 
            type="range" 
            id="blender-temp" 
            min="20" 
            max="100" 
            step="1" 
            value="90" 
            class="w-full h-2 bg-surface-soft rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-orange-600"
          />
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-muted mt-1 font-mono">
            <span>20°C (Cold)</span>
            <span>50°C (Warm)</span>
            <span>75°C (Hot)</span>
            <span>90°C (Simmer)</span>
            <span>100°C (Boil)</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1 leading-normal">
            {d.tempHelp}
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Control 3: Viscosity -->
        <div>
          <label for="blender-viscosity" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-ink mb-1">
            {d.viscLabel}
          </label>
          <select 
            id="blender-viscosity" 
            class="w-full bg-surface text-ink text-xs rounded-xl border border-hairline px-3 py-2.5 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-500/30 focus:outline-hidden"
          >
            {blenderData.blendingViscosities.map((v) => (
              <option value={v.id} selected={v.id === 'visc_med_1200'}>
                {v.name}
              </option>
            ))}
          </select>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1 leading-normal">
            {d.viscHelp}
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Control 4: Blade Speed -->
        <div>
          <label for="blender-speed" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-ink mb-1">
            {d.speedLabel}
          </label>
          <select 
            id="blender-speed" 
            class="w-full bg-surface text-ink text-xs rounded-xl border border-hairline px-3 py-2.5 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-500/30 focus:outline-hidden"
          >
            {blenderData.rotorSpeeds.map((s) => (
              <option value={s.id} selected={s.id === 'speed_16000'}>
                {s.name}
              </option>
            ))}
          </select>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1 leading-normal">
            {d.speedHelp}
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Control 5: Duration -->
        <div>
          <label for="blender-duration" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-ink mb-1">
            {d.durationLabel}
          </label>
          <select 
            id="blender-duration" 
            class="w-full bg-surface text-ink text-xs rounded-xl border border-hairline px-3 py-2.5 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-500/30 focus:outline-hidden"
          >
            {blenderData.blendingDurations.map((dur) => (
              <option value={dur.id} selected={dur.id === 'dur_5m'}>
                {dur.name}
              </option>
            ))}
          </select>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1 leading-normal">
            {d.durationHelp}
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Control 6: Matrix -->
        <div>
          <label for="blender-matrix" class="block text-xs font-semibold text-ink mb-1">
            {d.matrixLabel}
          </label>
          <select 
            id="blender-matrix" 
            class="w-full bg-surface text-ink text-xs rounded-xl border border-hairline px-3 py-2.5 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-orange-500/30 focus:outline-hidden"
          >
            {blenderData.foodMatrices.map((m) => (
              <option value={m.id} selected={m.id === 'matrix_acidic_tomato'}>
                {m.name}
              </option>
            ))}
          </select>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-muted mt-1 leading-normal">
            {d.matrixHelp}
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Telemetry Diagnostic Column (Right) -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
      <div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-hairline/60 pb-3">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-ink">
              {d.diagnosticTitle}
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted">
              {d.diagnosticSub}
            </p>
          </div>
          <span id="badge-verdict" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-400 border border-rose-500/20">
            PROHIBITED / HAZARD
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Diagnostic Metric 1: Leaching into Food -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">{d.leachingLabel}</span>
            <span id="val-leaching-ppm" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400">
              46.8 mg/kg (4.7x FDA Ceiling)
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-surface-soft rounded-full h-2.5 overflow-hidden border border-hairline/50">
            <div id="bar-leaching" class="bg-rose-600 h-2.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 88%;"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] text-muted mt-1 font-mono">
            <span>0 ppm (Pure)</span>
            <span class="text-emerald-600 font-bold">10 ppm (FDA Limit)</span>
            <span>25 ppm</span>
            <span>50+ ppm (Severe)</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Diagnostic Metric 2: Seal Thermal Stress -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">{d.sealStressLabel}</span>
            <span id="val-seal-stress" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">
              82% (Critical Softening & Creep)
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-surface-soft rounded-full h-2.5 overflow-hidden border border-hairline/50">
            <div id="bar-seal-stress" class="bg-amber-500 h-2.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 82%;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Diagnostic Metric 3: Cavitation & Rotor Shearing -->
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-ink">{d.cavitationLabel}</span>
            <span id="val-cavitation" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400">
              74 / 100 (Micro-Jet Erosion Active)
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-surface-soft rounded-full h-2.5 overflow-hidden border border-hairline/50">
            <div id="bar-cavitation" class="bg-orange-500 h-2.5 rounded-full transition-all duration-300" style="width: 74%;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Detailed Breakdown Box -->
        <div class="bg-surface-soft/80 border border-hairline rounded-xl p-4 space-y-3 text-xs">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted mb-1">
              {d.complianceLabel}
            </div>
            <div id="text-compliance-status" class="font-medium text-ink">
              FDA 21 CFR § 178.3570: NON-COMPLIANT • Prohibited toxic petroleum hydrocarbon migration into culinary food matrix.
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="border-t border-hairline/60 pt-2.5">
            <div class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted mb-1">
              {d.mechanismLabel}
            </div>
            <p id="text-mechanism-desc" class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
              At 90°C in an acidic tomato matrix, the NBR lip seal experiences rapid thermal softening and acid swelling (28%). The high blade speed (16,000 RPM) creates a deep hydrodynamic depression zone behind the blade bell, creating negative suction gauge pressure that draws thinned petroleum grease past the relaxed lip seal directly into the culinary emulsion.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-t border-hairline/60 pt-2.5">
            <div class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted mb-1">
              {d.guidanceLabel}
            </div>
            <p id="text-guidance-desc" class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
              Remove the pot from the active stovetop burner and cool soup below 70°C (158°F) before using a domestic hand blender, or upgrade to a commercial power mixer with a hermetic double mechanical silicon carbide face seal certified under NSF/ANSI Standard 8.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Copy Telemetry Button -->
        <div class="pt-2">
          <button 
            id="btn-copy-telemetry" 
            type="button" 
            class="w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-orange-700 hover:bg-orange-800 text-white font-medium text-xs transition-colors shadow-xs flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"
          >
            <span>📋</span>
            <span>{d.copyReportBtn}</span>
          </button>
          <div id="copy-feedback-msg" class="text-center text-xs text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-medium mt-2 hidden">
            ✓ {d.copiedFeedback}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Engineering Science Deep-Dive Table -->
  <div class="border-t border-hairline/80 pt-10 mb-10">
    <div class="mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight">
        {d.tableTitle}
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">
        {d.tableSub}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-xs text-left border-collapse border border-hairline rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
        <thead class="bg-surface/80 border-b border-hairline text-ink font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[11px]">
          <tr>
            <th class="p-3 border-r border-hairline">{d.colArch}</th>
            <th class="p-3 border-r border-hairline">{d.colBearing}</th>
            <th class="p-3 border-r border-hairline">{d.colSealMat}</th>
            <th class="p-3 border-r border-hairline text-center">{d.colTempCeiling}</th>
            <th class="p-3 border-r border-hairline">{d.colGreaseClass}</th>
            <th class="p-3">{d.colCompliance}</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-hairline bg-surface/40 text-muted">
          {blenderData.shaftSealArchitectures.map((item) => (
            <tr class="hover:bg-surface-soft/60 transition-colors">
              <td class="p-3 font-semibold text-ink border-r border-hairline">{item.name}</td>
              <td class="p-3 border-r border-hairline">{item.bearingType}</td>
              <td class="p-3 border-r border-hairline font-mono">{item.sealMaterial}</td>
              <td class="p-3 border-r border-hairline text-center font-mono font-bold text-ink">{item.sealTempCeilingC}°C</td>
              <td class="p-3 border-r border-hairline">{item.greaseChemistry}</td>
              <td class="p-3">
                <span class={`inline-block px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-bold ${item.isNsfH1Certified ? 'bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20' : 'bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-700 dark:text-rose-400 border border-rose-500/20'}`}>
                  {item.isNsfH1Certified ? 'NSF H1 Certified' : 'Non-Food Industrial'}
                </span>
              </td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Mandatory Safety Protocols -->
  <div class="border-t border-hairline/80 pt-10">
    <div class="mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-ink tracking-tight">
        {d.rulesTitle}
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1">
        {d.rulesSub}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-2xs">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink mb-2 text-orange-700 dark:text-orange-400">
          {d.rule1Title}
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed">
          {d.rule1Text}
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-2xs">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink mb-2 text-orange-700 dark:text-orange-400">
          {d.rule2Title}
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed">
          {d.rule2Text}
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-2xs">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink mb-2 text-orange-700 dark:text-orange-400">
          {d.rule3Title}
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted leading-relaxed">
          {d.rule3Text}
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface border border-hairline rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-2xs">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-ink mb-2 text-orange-700 dark:text-orange-400">
          {d.rule4Title}
